#. y1:english="Well,{PA:10} there is a customer||who hasn't paid off any of his tab...\nSo my wife's giving me a lot of shit...\nIt'd be satisfied||if I got even half of the amount.\nYou know, the customer's a Yakuza.\nI see.\nReally?!{PA:10} You really mean it?\nThat's very reassuring.{MS:1}{MS:0}{PA:20}||Then, please take this.\nYou received the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Tab{CR:00}\".\nPlease give the tab to the Yakuza||and collect the money from him.\nI'll give you half of the money.\nWhere's the Yakuza?\nI heard that he frequents a casino||somewhere...{PA:20}\nI don't know where it is exactly...\nYou'll know||when you see him in the casino.\nYeah,{PA:10} well...{PA:20} What should I do||about it?{PA:20} I don't know what to do..."
