#. y1:english="About the Yakuza who refuses to pay his||tab... What the hell should I do about him?\nReally?!{PA:10} You really mean it?\nThat's very reassuring.{MS:1}{MS:0}{PA:20}||Then, please take this.\nYou received the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Tab{CR:00}\".\nPlease give the tab to the Yakuza||and collect the money from him.\nI'll give you half of the money.\nWhere's the Yakuza?\nI heard that he frequents a casino||somewhere...{PA:20}\nI don't know where it is exactly...\nBut he always wears a distinct green suit.{MS:0}{PA:20}||You'll know when you see him in the casino.\nYeah, {PA:10}well...{PA:20} What should I do||about it? I don't know what to do..."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0088.BIN:19_2_11
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0088.BIN::line:19_2_11"
msgid "Sí,{PA:10} bueno...{PA:20}||¿Qué debo hacer con esto? No sé que hacer..."
msgstr ""

