#. y1:english="Welcome.\nIs Shotaro here?\nAre you an acquaintance?\nReally...{PA:20} Are you gonna order something?\n...Well,{PA:10} I'll give you a little quiz.{PA:20}\nTry to guess which drink is||the most expensive in here.\nHumph.{PA:20}||Piss off.\nWell, if it's none of my business,{PA:10}||I guess I won't tell you then.\nYou better watch what you say to me.{PA:20}||I got nothing more to say to you.\nHumph,{PA:10} it's pretty obvious, isn't it?{PA:20}||It's Bowmore 40 Years.\nThat was an easy question.{PA:20}||I gave you that one.\nIt's pretty premium spirit. {PA:10}There may||be only one bottle in this entire city.\nI've never even had it before.\nI like you.{PA:10} I'll tell you about Shotaro.\nShotaro doesn't work here anymore.\nHe quit about 3 months ago and started||working at a host bar called {MS:0}\"{CC:ffc8c8}Stardust{CR:00}\".\nHe said he wanted to become the number one||host in this town.{PA:20}\nHe goes by the name Shota there.\n"
